From 7f5e822c2a64e2017fe6aad55e5e205f4e1c2f23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 14:10:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Issue 26082217204646 Exp 6: forward CaptureOverlay
 request/reply

Raise max_frame_size to 16 MiB so overlay PNGs fit. Route TUI
CaptureOverlayRequest to the pane engine and engine replies to the
owning TUI. Unknown panes fail-soft with ok=false.
